# Putting it All Toghether: Revisiting the Final Project

## Interactive Data Dashboard

In Unit 4’s final project, students take on the role of data designers and developers to build an **Interactive Data Dashboard** that responds to user input.

Throughout the unit, students practiced the same techniques they will apply in this project: filtering datasets, summarizing information, making design decisions about labels and defaults, and using AI tools thoughtfully to support, *not replace,* their own logic.

---

